{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：11:00 2026-09-15 HKT</p>\n\n<p>「性感女神」鍾麗緹育有三名高顏值愛女，其中剛滿18歲的二女張思捷（Jaden）今年5月高中畢業，遠赴美國波士頓升讀大學。日前有網民在北京機場直擊鍾麗緹親自為女兒送行，一眾粉絲亦專程早起前來送別。當日母女二人打扮休閒，鍾麗緹戴上漁夫帽配輕便長褲，女兒則身穿粉紅色貼身深V長袖衫，大晒青春無敵的白滑肌膚，母女全程手牽手，有說有笑，在人群中非常搶鏡。</p>\n<h2>鍾麗緹送二女赴美升學</h2>\n<p>隨著離別時刻漸近，臨進閘前，鍾麗緹的離愁別緒頓時湧上心頭，緊緊擁抱住女兒，更忍不住親吻女兒臉頰，充滿不捨之情，場面溫馨感人。而張思捷亦深情回抱，隨後獨自轉身入閘。期間她盡顯乖巧貼心一面，不時回頭與媽媽及粉絲揮手甜笑，網民大讚她亭亭玉立，越大越靚，星味十足。</p>\n<img alt=\"鍾麗緹二女張思捷與細妹張凱琳感情要好。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/baba7d7768aee3119b5b59a67d7717de/2022-11/jaden_4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾麗緹二女與細女都越大越靚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7785d9e4ea01ff09b47590bdb85fe03d/2024-03/bkn-20240317180102969-0317_00862_001_02p.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾麗緹與張倫碩年齡相差12年。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/adce11017ed1242ea58bf03c27521bcd/2022-04/002dFX8mly1gy5fcrb0dij60nq0zkgsj02.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾麗緹與現任丈夫張倫碩一家四口定居北京。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c029cd105dd73c948740d66fd16b631c/2022-11/jaden_8.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾麗緹與二女兒張思捷近日齊齊現身機場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c34b90300fbe9fd4641cadc3fb7f5d87/2026-09/VS--jaden-rednote-0_01_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張思捷要到美國波士頓大學升學。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4369263d2549b2ab3f8f9060bc04c854/2026-09/VS--jaden-rednote-0_04_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張思捷長得亭亭玉立，身材惹火，更向現場粉絲揮手道別。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e7f390cba962b1d016229d52ce01f2fe/2026-09/VS--jaden-rednote-0_15_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"網民讚張思捷越大越靚，甚有星味。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a8cd9f0dc7b87728147558d6b6de4ae6/2026-09/VS--jaden-rednote-0_18_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾麗緹為女兒Jaden戴上首飾，盡顯母女情深。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ac5ec33fe6b6e7992f281d40cded8377/2026-07/3951334862478551710_190129891.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾麗緹送上載滿成長回憶的相片集作為Jaden的生日禮物。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/33e9dd19b3965b7f0e3a84a9c52704f5/2026-07/3951334865003498985_190129891.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾麗緹與丈夫張倫碩為Jaden戴上皇冠，象徵她正式成年。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9ba3ed7d59cd19923f003f9bc54b39a9/2026-07/3951334867687862486_190129891.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"頭戴皇冠的Jaden在派對上發言，感謝到場的親友。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d44d343938076d624ba6d5eb5ee12990/2026-07/3951334874541414338_190129891.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Jaden戴上皇冠化身公主，展現甜美笑容。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8a8e16a70fde5549161dacfde50825dc/2026-07/3951334875958992990_190129891.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Jaden為精緻的四層高生日蛋糕點上蠟燭。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/eb00d4ec6e957288fa4bc95ba3f44218/2026-07/3951334883726740593_190129891.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾麗緹一家四口盛裝合照，畫面溫馨和睦。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e4a22a40baf2107033326f2b01f34238/2026-07/3951334884288993199_190129891.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾麗緹親自點燃場地燭光，為女兒的派對打點細節。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2ab3b4ad9737114a8571988594176241/2026-07/3951334889707836595_190129891.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾麗緹與幼女張凱琳合照，母女大鬥性感。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a52c1d182c1457ca1b69cf0a7cd196fd/2026-07/3951334894246265235_190129891.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾麗緹穿上透視晚裝，身材保養得宜，艷壓全場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f81fe7cd1db77ce825e3bf4f2c79f097/2026-07/3951334894279675350_190129891.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾麗緹與父母合照，三代同堂共享喜悅。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1a4ac8f7e6b410eed0449706151113f9/2026-07/3951334898557839784_190129891.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾麗緹在璀璨的水晶燈與花海前留影，盡顯高貴氣質。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/05a9eeb9f7ea21291bfa09dcee5c3e86/2026-07/3951334900042762675_190129891.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"派對現場以「Cheers to 18 years」為主題，佈置夢幻奢華。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3e85827da9585283a43fbf43bb180a4c/2026-07/3951334905184874519_190129891.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾麗緹突然亂入，引發了張思捷疑似藏起電子煙的風波。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7e4907350cda61617cdbd19cce04c696/2026-07/jaden__1_j1eden__.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾麗緹忙於為老公慶生，暫時未有為女兒張思捷發聲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8eba8479fc46699d2c25d6a407d7c4b9/2026-07/002dFX8mly1if14cadplij62c0340x6p02.jpg\"/>\n<h2>鍾麗緹二女疑曾吸食電子煙</h2>\n<p>外表甜美乖巧，向來以自律學霸形象示人的張思捷，早前卻曾爆出「偷吸電子煙」疑雲。今年7月她在房內開直播與粉絲閒聊時，鍾麗緹突然無預警推門入房，張思捷當場嚇到雙眼瞪大、神色極度慌張，下意識將枱面上疑似電子煙的長條物塞入枱底。待媽媽離開後，她更驚魂未定地狂拍心口直呼「嚇死我了」，而隨著7月底18歲成人禮獲父母加冕，這場青春期小叛逆已成過去。</p>\n<img alt=\"鍾麗緹的兩名女兒張思捷（右）及張凱琳。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ef41252e0f560e28c09cb4a40b27b556/2026-07/3891646671826287905_190129891.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾麗緹細女張凱琳早前爆爭議。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8fad9374bceb981111eaca1caa34b362/2026-03/CAP6_3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾麗緹細女Cayla在廁所自拍時，疑曝光家姐Jaden如廁畫面。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/53a391fcc58f5d46e295ec3e18396b30/2026-03/CAP5_4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾麗緹的三個女兒感情好。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fb6dbec1f851f7179a56b0f174783bca/2026-03/002dFX8mgy1ia0tshggucj62c03407wk02.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾麗緹於3月面對考拉疑拍到家姐如廁，曾發聲明指坐在馬桶上的不是Jaden。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8972febc40404c1ab51ca8ea3323d4de/2026-06/A_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"考拉廁所自拍照近日再次成為熱話，鍾麗緹被指講大話，她近日發聲明指自己非刻意說謊，並指已嚴厲教訓考拉。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d6ee1eb2e25e97e5660c550062ab5c95/2026-06/B_4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張凱琳2016年已跟張倫碩一起參加親子節目《爸爸去哪兒4》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a62f45a4918b9b6647c229a533e99e01/2024-03/C1_5.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾麗緹的女兒盡得媽咪真傳。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0038ddfc72509fed7032196843e4a8af/2024-09/cayla_0206_1723379636_3432279616439551850_49890984961.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾麗緹女兒是美人胚子。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/881bd8f431bcc24c161c0d5af6440aa1/2024-09/cayla_0206_1722185194_3422259908399089270_49890984961.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾麗緹曾在直播時透露細女Cayla有眼疾問題。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8ca73e665284f2207961cf9a8ff5db0b/2026-01/CAP_21_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾麗緹細女Cayla都有清純一面。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/64e10de335324b83bf9c6a5000b3c2be/2024-09/cayla_0206_1711119417_3329433450044002332_49890984961.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾麗緹細女Cayla烈風式成長驚為天人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b9ab2da7482d20fc9798126a51d1f81c/2024-09/cayla_0206_1723980318_3437318503429378905_49890984961.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾麗緹細女Cayla越大越靚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1718bdbbf10bc95899f79491bdfaeeba/2024-09/cayla_0206_1723980318_3437318503429536972_49890984961.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張凱琳晒出與友人食飯的靚相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3a04a563ffb9106bcba3d517984b9e14/2024-03/bkn-20240317180102969-0317_00862_001_04p.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張凱琳突然脫下外套晒身材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9dc9c5e332d6ec0a74eecd0789b29ad3/2024-03/_Aso70tXtfm_wBXb6_v5D9XiCxnlZsWUFfsclBX7HJQ.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"​網民認為張凱琳女大十八變。​\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b399042e59d9543d43c037b2d642fc32/2024-03/Ng4vFw7iQwhKwVW74VoIeCU4FqZyCzgra8YFKGvGBSg.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"當年只有6歲的張凱琳，被暱稱為考拉。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2a95af79c89efc35ac177f02add6ea00/2024-03/C2_5.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張凱琳小時候樣子萌爆。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c3203f3aa3339363fa3c5757bdad5487/2024-03/7GeaqlUCJ-tuJdaZXwFr7xxqHGYkrxnaA9RG8gPURvI.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張凱琳小時候已經好可愛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/35a11804c97fbe69d08f8663da9dd12e/2024-03/o4Sh_ObhcPHSQYYkOIHiqtD5Ixsn_QsJqefgOKnn4Dg.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張凱琳可謂由細靚到大。​\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4da416f76daf06640b84b9f1e79fc0e0/2024-03/hxUh2VYW-5-fJ_gxCJGrkKSWRfgLTDPCeLlx53i5cec.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾麗緹細女已經16歲，長得亭亭玉立。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/86e11da3cafd1cf27e5ec0fd6fd31831/2024-03/cMVt4zkIOuRveDlmbQDzIIHXniLALh-IiJEVPoiRFT4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"近年張凱琳更以暴風式成長。​\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0a4be6c1db39edaf7618cf91e821bffe/2024-03/YVTMIyKLHNKr-rNdDLJrbNRRRswOiG_ronq7XqJ6u14.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾麗緹經常分享一家四口照片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/39162a3f2d4163ed1da0f845edbbaae9/2022-11/jaden_7.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾麗緹夫婦不時帶兩女四圍去。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/027d7fd2a8db93d8340623f2c9c3d44d/2023-08/Christy_7_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾麗緹長女張敏鈞是水上運動愛好者。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9b9614c2b8e8060aff8143c4bac686d3/2023-07/241037611_261062265684177_3299032472839377671_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張敏鈞不吝惜身材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5a33d6a31dd4dc6ae8a203b22036e307/2025-01/yasmineross__1736046295_3538535258148632508_10553566.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張敏鈞遺傳母親的美貌與身材。  ​\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8ea9f962063c599173fc434d54372daa/2023-07/285607612_685314712562207_5478690618922403810_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張敏鈞經常在IG晒美好身段。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/33b94070dcccab09b6f8f9032a978d41/2023-07/161000380_258160919191712_1768300864524126617_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張敏鈞經常在IG派福利。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/faf11f2107a943898c889f335e288276/2023-07/358462195_18371974243057567_2330704644685024388_n.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-15T03:20:33.104292+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":520,"images":52,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}